                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Average Everyday Adventures of Samantha Browne is a beautifully drawn visual novel that's cute, pleasant to play, and absolutely terrifying in its own way. Watching Samantha struggle with something as simple as interacting with other people is both relatable and painful. And they ignored her AGAIN? Come on, that's just cruel. Next time, she should set the microwave on fire and use the smoke as cover to sneak back into her room. Holy balls of fire! At least she'd have a proper escape plan!",
